   "en": "\"Marriage, marriage! Let's get married right now~!!\"\n\nWhile on a reporting trip in Taiwan, Rintarou picks up a black envelope he finds on the street. Suddenly, a cute ghost shows up and starts calling him her husband! And that’s not enough, she follows him back to Japan and keeps bugging him to officially marry her...\n\n(Source: Manga Park, translated)"
